  "details": "There is a slowdown in certain game worlds, making it impossible to play the game properly.\n\nAs for the situation, I'm using vive, but when the game starts, it becomes slow.\n\nOtherwise, you can move at normal speed.\n\nI didn't know where to post this so I asked a question.",
